OL,3,GNEWSAPatients urge more blood donors to
OL,4,Astep forward
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who needed three blood
OL,7,Ftransfusions has encouraged islanders
OL,8,Fto become blood donors, and said doing
OL,9,Fso "could save someone's life".
OL,11,FA Freedom of Information request showed
OL,12,Fthe number of blood donations in the
OL,13,Fisland fell from 1,808 in 2023 to 1,655
OL,14,Fin 2025.
OL,16,FJosephine Baker lost 3.5 litres of
OL,17,Fblood during the birth of her second
OL,18,Fchild in 2020 and said "you can't
OL,19,Fpredict when someone will need a
OL,20,Fdonation".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
