OL,3,GNEWSAPatients urge more blood donors to
OL,4,Astep forward
OL,5,
OL,6,FClaire Thompson, from Health and Care,
OL,7,Fsaid the service does "not have any
OL,8,Fissues with blood stocks" but new
OL,9,Fdonors were "always welcome".
